  "question": {
    "html": "<p>A light ray passes from vacuum into a crystal. The ray is partially refracted and partially reflected at the boundary between the vacuum and the crystal. </p>\n\n<figure data-asset-id=\"fig_01\"><img alt=\"Source question diagram 1\" src=\"asset:fig_01\"/></figure>\n\n<p>What is the refractive index of the crystal?</p>\n<p></p>\n<ol class=\"mcq-options\">\n<li data-label=\"A\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin(35^{o})}{sin(55^{o})}\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"B\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"tan(55^{o})\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"C\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"tan(35^{o})\"></span></li>\n<li data-label=\"D\"><span class=\"math\" data-latex=\"\\frac{sin(35^{o})}{cos(55^{o})}\"></span></li>\n</ol>"
  },
